# Resilient Roadrunner (CR 702.10a haste, 509.1b): Bot1 casts it on turn 1 and attacks with it at once (haste), Bot2 at 18. "{3}: can't be blocked this turn except by creatures with
# haste": with only the two untapped Moxes (two mana) the activation is refused, on turn 3 three Moxes pay it exactly (the pool ends empty). Llanowar Elves (no haste) may then not
# block it but Fanatical Firebrand, which has haste as blockers are declared, may, and dies to the Roadrunner (2 damage) while dealing it 1. The restriction ends with the turn
# (CR 514.2): on turn 5, with no activation, Llanowar Elves blocks it and is killed.

